    "blind    - both backends/<tier>/emit.py and selfhost/emit_<tier>.rvl",
    "           implement this construct and no document in the tier's CORPUS",
    "           reaches it, so the oracle compares bytes that never differ.",
    "           Reason-first: the reason is the entry, the constructs are its",
    "           evidence. Every entry is a decision someone made; write it down.",
    "unported - backends/<tier>/emit.py implements it, the port does not, and no",
    "           corpus document would notice. This is the shape of the item",
    "           429(d) Secret[T] gap: the reference redacted, the self-host did",
    "           not, every oracle stayed green. A ratchet baseline.",
    "",
    "Both halves only shrink on their own. An entry that coverage has caught up",
    "with FAILS as stale and must be deleted. Never widen this file to silence a",
    "failure you have not read: the fix is normally a corpus document, added",
    "BEFORE the port and seen to fail."
